---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <Navbar />

  <!-- Main Wrapper with generous spacing for readable architecture -->
  <div class="pt-24 md:pt-32 px-6 flex-grow">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      
      <!-- HERO / HOME SECTION -->
      <header id="home" class="py-16 md:py-24 border-b border-[#607264]/10">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-[#607264] font-semibold mb-4">
          Welcome to Rooted Moon Medicinals
        </p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-[#1e2f23] leading-tight max-w-4xl">
          Nourishing the roots of your health through integrated Midwifery, Functional Medicine, Somatic Bodywork, and Plant Medicine.
        </h1>
        
        <div class="mt-12 max-w-3xl text-lg md:text-xl text-[#1e2f23]/90 space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="font-medium text-[#3c2f2f]">
            Welcome to Rooted Moon Medicinals—a sanctuary where the analytical meets the intuitive, and where true healing is honored as a holistic, lifelong journey.
          </p>
          <p>
            As a team of multi-passionate practitioners, we believe that optimal wellness cannot be achieved in isolation. Your physical architecture, your hormonal symphony, your birthing experiences, and the remedies you bring into your home are all profoundly interconnected. Whether you are navigating the sacred threshold of expanding your family, seeking answers to chronic health mysteries through functional lab analysis, or looking to release stored trauma from your nervous system, you are not meant to walk this path alone.
          </p>
          <p class="pt-4 font-semibold tracking-wide text-xs uppercase text-[#607264]">
            Four Pillars of Foundational Care
          </p>
          
          <!-- Pillars Grid -->
          <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 mt-6">
            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f4f6f4] border border-[#607264]/10">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#3c2f2f] mb-2">Midwifery & Postpartum Care</h3>
              <p class="text-base text-[#607264]">Protecting the peace, safety, and sovereignty of your birthing space, ensuring that your transition into parenthood is rooted in absolute love and physiological safety.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f4f6f4] border border-[#607264]/10">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#3c2f2f] mb-2">Functional Medicine Coaching</h3>
              <p class="text-base text-[#607264]">Blending rigorous biochemistry and comprehensive lab analysis with intuitive lifestyle shifts to uncover the root causes of imbalance and reclaim your vital energy.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f4f6f4] border border-[#607264]/10">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#3c2f2f] mb-2">Bodywork & Somatic Practice</h3>
              <p class="text-base text-[#607264]">Facilitating deep nervous system regulation, structural alignment, and trauma release for both childbearing parents and infants through gentle, collaborative touch.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f4f6f4] border border-[#607264]/10">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#3c2f2f] mb-2">Plant Offerings & Botanical Medicine</h3>
              <p class="text-base text-[#607264]">Providing an uncompromisingly pure, small-batch apothecary crafted from beyond-organic, ethically wild-harvested ingredients to nourish your daily rituals.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <p class="pt-4 text-base italic text-[#607264]">
            This is care that respects the innate wisdom of your body, honors the rhythms of nature, and stands firmly on a foundation of clinical excellence. No matter where you are on your healing continuum, you are welcome here.
          </p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- HOME BIRTH SECTION -->
      <section id="homebirth" class="py-16 md:py-24 border-b border-[#607264]/10">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#607264] font-semibold">Sanctuary & Sovereignty</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-2 text-[#3c2f2f]">Home Birth</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xl md:text-2xl italic text-[#607264] max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
          Peace on Earth Begins with Birth. Creating an Imprint of Safety, Wholeness, and Love from the Very First Breath.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-base md:text-lg text-[#1e2f23]/90 space-y-6">
          <p>
            We hold a foundational truth close to our hearts: wherever you feel the safest is exactly where you are meant to give birth. Whether that sanctuary is the familiar comfort of your own home, the dedicated space of a birth center, or within a hospital setting, your sense of safety is the north star of your birthing journey.
          </p>
          <p>
            Birth is not just a physiological event; it is a profound neurological and spiritual initiation. Welcoming a new life into the world in a peaceful, loving, and calm atmosphere does something extraordinary—it provides a newborn’s developing brain with a primary imprint of safety and love designed to last a lifetime. By protecting the peace of the birth space, we actively cultivate a more peaceful world, one gentle arrival at a time.
          </p>
          <p class="font-medium text-[#3c2f2f]">
            Our care is built to honor this sacred transition, blending clinical expertise with deep reverence for your choices, your body, and your baby's first moments.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- BODY WORK SECTION -->
      <section id="bodywork" class="py-16 md:py-24 border-b border-[#607264]/10">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#607264] font-semibold">Somatic Touch & Perinatal Bodywork: From Conception to Infancy</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-2 text-[#3c2f2f]">Reclaiming the Architecture of Your Body</h2>
        <p class="text-lg font-medium text-[#607264] mt-2">Somatic Integration for the Childbearing Year & Infancy</p>
        
        <div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-base md:text-lg text-[#1e2f23]/90 space-y-6">
          <p>
            The physical transitions of bringing life into the world are profound. Your body expands, shifts, and creates an entirely new blueprint to carry, birth, and hold your baby—and your baby experiences an equally intense journey navigating their way into the world.
          </p>
          <p>
            We do not believe in a one-size-fits-all massage. Every session we facilitate is a customized, intuitive, and bio-mechanically informed blend of therapeutic modalities designed to meet your nervous system and your structural alignment exactly where they are today. By weaving clinical depth, structural balancing, and sensory comfort, we create a supportive space where your body can drop its armor, release deep-seated trauma, and restore its natural equilibrium.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#3c2f2f] pt-4">The Modalities We Weave Together</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li><strong>Dynamic Body Balancing (DBB) & Pelvic Alignment:</strong> Grounded in craniosacral therapy and myofascial release principles, this targeted work restores balance to the pelvic muscles and ligaments. By addressing restrictions in the pelvic bowl, we optimize space for your baby’s positioning during pregnancy and facilitate deep structural restoration postpartum.</li>
            <li><strong>Craniosacral Therapy (CST) & Somatic Touch:</strong> A profoundly gentle touch that releases restrictions around the central nervous system. This modality supports deep cellular relaxation, helps resolve physical and emotional trauma held in the tissue, and promotes natural fluid flow.</li>
            <li><strong>Therapeutic Foundations:</strong> A fluid, intuitive blend of Deep Tissue to release chronic structural tension, Swedish for nervous system down-regulation, and Thai massage techniques to open up compressed joints and improve overall mobility.</li>
            <li><strong>Sensory & Thermal Comfort:</strong> Every table session is elevated with warmed towels, hot rocks to melt away muscular tightness, sound healing to soothe the subconscious mind, and curated aromatherapy to ground your senses.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#3c2f2f] pt-4">Postpartum Specialization & Sacred Ceremony</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li><strong>Closing the Bones Ceremony:</strong> A sacred, traditional ritual utilizing cloth wrapping to gently pull the hips and pelvic bones back together, providing a profound sense of containment, emotional integration, and physical closure after the expansiveness of birth.</li>
            <li><strong>Moxibustion & Thermal Therapy:</strong> The application of gentle, targeted herbal heat (moxa) over specific energetic pathways to restore vital warmth, improve circulation, and build back depleted energy stores after birth.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#3c2f2f] pt-4">Somatic Touch for Infancy & Beyond</h3>
          <p>
            Infants are not passive recipients of care—their bodies possess an incredible, innate wisdom and a natural blueprint for alignment. Often, a baby’s body already knows exactly how to unravel its own tension; it simply needs the right, supportive space to do so. Our approach to infant bodywork is deeply collaborative, working alongside both you and your baby to facilitate natural self-correction, comfort, and physical ease.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li><strong>Pediatric Craniosacral Therapy & Alignment:</strong> Using a touch as light as the weight of a nickel, this subtle modality helps newborns release structural compressions from birth, improves latching and feeding alignment, settles hyper-sensitive nervous systems, and eases colic, reflux, or digestive tension.</li>
            <li><strong>Dynamic Body Balancing (DBB) for Infants:</strong> Gentle, motion-based unwinding that helps babies release soft tissue restrictions, optimizing their mobility, comfort, and structural symmetry after birth.</li>
            <li><strong>Co-Regulation & Parent Education:</strong> We want you to feel empowered long after our session ends. We actively teach you how to read your baby’s subtle somatic cues and guide you in simple, gentle bodywork techniques you can practice at home, making you an active partner in your baby's physical ease.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- PLANT OFFERINGS SECTION -->
      <section id="apothecary" class="py-16 md:py-24 border-b border-[#607264]/10">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#607264] font-semibold">Small-Batch Apothecary</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-2 text-[#3c2f2f]">Purity Without Compromise</h2>
        <p class="text-lg font-medium text-[#607264] mt-2">Uncompromising Standards, Organic Solvents, and Locally Gathered Medicine</p>
        
        <div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-base md:text-lg text-[#1e2f23]/90 space-y-6">
          <p>
            We believe that the medicine we create can only be as vibrant as the soil it grew in and the care with which it was gathered. That is why we hold our small-batch apothecary to an uncompromising standard of purity, combining the meticulousness of clinical safety with a deep reverence for the earth.
          </p>
          <p class="font-medium text-[#3c2f2f]">Every single remedy we craft begins with premium, intentional ingredients:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 pl-2 border-l-2 border-[#607264]/30">
            <li><strong>Beyond-Organic Sourcing:</strong> We utilize "better-than-organic" botanical ingredients, focusing on plants that are grown using regenerative, chemical-free methods that honor the health of the soil.</li>
            <li><strong>Hyper-Local & Sustainable:</strong> Our first priority is always to look right outside our door. We rely on plants that are locally grown or sustainably and ethically wild-harvested. We only source outside of our immediate region when a specific plant is absolutely necessary for targeted therapeutic care and cannot be found nearby.</li>
            <li><strong>Pure Organic Solvents:</strong> For our tinctures, we use exclusively 100% organic alcohol and organic menstruums. We never cut corners with standard commercial spirits, ensuring that the final extract is clean, potent, and entirely free from synthetic pesticide residues or GMO derivatives.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="pt-2 italic">
            From seed to bottle, every step is handled with the highest level of integrity, so you can feel completely confident bringing these remedies into your home, your postpartum nest, and your family's daily wellness rituals.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- WHO WE ARE SECTION -->
      <section id="about" class="py-16 md:py-24 border-b border-[#607264]/10">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#607264] font-semibold">Our Practice</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-2 text-[#3c2f2f]">Who We Are</h2>
        <div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-base md:text-lg text-[#1e2f23]/90">
          <p class="italic text-[#607264]">
            [Space reserved for your team narrative, collective qualifications, and the shared path that brought you together to integrate midwifery, science, and herbal alchemy.]
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- CONTACT SECTION (CLOUDFLARE COMPATIBLE) -->
      <section id="contact" class="py-16 md:py-24">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#607264] font-semibold">Get in Touch</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-2 text-[#3c2f2f]">Begin Your Journey</h2>
        <p class="text-base text-[#607264] mt-2 max-w-xl">
          Have questions about home birth, somatic sessions, or our apothecary offerings? Reach out below.
        </p>

        <!-- Form works seamlessly out-of-the-box on static hosting like Cloudflare Pages via Formspree, Cloudflare Turnstile/Workers, or Pages Plugins -->
        <form 
          action="https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id" 
          method="POST" 
          class="mt-10 max-w-xl space-y-6 bg-[#f4f6f4] p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[#607264]/10 shadow-sm"
        >
          <div>
            <label for="name" class="block text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-[#1e2f23] mb-2">Name</label>
            <input 
              type="text" 
              id="name" 
              name="name" 
              required 
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#607264]/20 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#1e2f23] text-[#1e2f23] transition-colors"
              placeholder="Your full name"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-[#1e2f23] mb-2">Email Address</label>
            <input 
              type="email" 
              id="email" 
              name="email" 
              required 
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#607264]/20 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#1e2f23] text-[#1e2f23] transition-colors"
              placeholder="you@example.com"
            />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="message" class="block text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-[#1e2f23] mb-2">Message</label>
            <textarea 
              id="message" 
              name="message" 
              rows="5" 
              required 
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#607264]/20 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#1e2f23] text-[#1e2f23] transition-colors resize-none"
              placeholder="How can we support you on your continuum of healing?"
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <button 
            type="submit" 
            class="w-full py-4 px-6 font-semibold tracking-wide text-white bg-[#1e2f23] rounded-xl hover:bg-[#607264] transition-all cursor-pointer shadow-md shadow-[#1e2f23]/10"
          >
            Send Message
          </button>
        </form>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="mt-20 border-t border-[#607264]/10 bg-[#f4f6f4] text-center text-xs md:text-sm text-[#607264] py-8 px-6">
    <p>© 2026 Rooted Moon Medicinals. All Rights Reserved. Respecting the innate wisdom of the body.</p>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>